Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, it's dark in here,\Ncan't see a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WHERE THE HELL IS THAT BASTARD ANYWAY?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,IT'S THE MIDDLE OF THE DAY AND I STILL\NHAVE TO FEEL MY WAY AROUND THIS HOVEL,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,THIS BETTER BE WORTH IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if I remember correctly,\NI'll find Dio over in that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting, this little lady\Nmust be one of Dio's leftovers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn bras just throw\Nthemselves at the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like having their blood drunk\Nis the latest bedroom craze.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole thing's nutty if you ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though girls do tend\Nto go for the bad boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But forget about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.32,0:00:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so much gold in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he get all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:01:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like this guy can have\Nand do just about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.14,0:01:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.91,0:01:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master... Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just looking at him is enough\Nto send chills down my spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it together, whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him spook you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's nothing to lose your cool over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's not even that\Nmuch stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you want something, whole horns?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, yes, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something I\Nthought you ought to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:01:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I received intel that two\Nof the nine great gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.86,0:02:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mariah and Alessi, have\Nbeen put out of commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your point is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got trouble coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out Joestar and his gang\Nwill arrive in Cairo tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.30,0:02:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and only three of the nine gods are left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems you've misunderstood my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know what you're\Ngoing to do, whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to have been\Ncaught rather off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply wish to know when you're\Ngoing to kill them, whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While it's true you've\Npledged your allegiance to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have yet to adequately\Nprove yourself in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this day and age, any\Nsimpleton can deliver information.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twice you've failed me, and\Nhere you are crawling back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:03:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but my body once belonged to a man\Nby the name of Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan was the grandfather\Nof Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Notice how the left finger heals\Nat a slower rate than the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The left side of this body is weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which proves that it doesn't\Ncompletely belong to me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that I am not yet immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am ill-equipped to fight a battle\Nwith Joestar and his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, if there is nothing else, run\Nalong and destroy my enemies on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Failure will most assuredly\Nresult in your untimely demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're burking up the wrong tree, Haas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if threats are gonna make me\Nroll over and do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your behalf, my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm smart enough to throw\Nin with whoever's strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.02,0:03:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything I've said has been lip service.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never swear my loyalty to\Nyou at the cost of my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rat bastard, you're not so tough, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess having another person's body\Nattached to your head has made you go soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to fight\NJoseph and the other three.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not when I've got Dio in my crosshairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be a hell of a lot easier to blow his\Nhead to smithereens right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I do, his treasures mine for the Taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know Emperor's\Naimed point blank at his skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can finish him off and\Nhe'll be none the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one pull of the trigger\Nand this nightmare will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, Emperor was made\Nfor close combat carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be hesitating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat lead, shitbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to splatter your brains\Nall over the floor, Mr. Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you positive you want to\Ngo through with shooting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you prepared to fire,\Nyour breathing was relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't even perspire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were composed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very impressive. Whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make a lick of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even see him move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell he\Ncould have crept up behind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me without breaking a single\None of those spider webs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fast or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.28,0:05:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he shouldn't have been able to sneak up\Nto my rear without me noticing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that the power of Dio's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of the world,\Nill-equipped? Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally understand, Master Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got no choice but to pledge\Nmy eternal loyalty to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:05:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got me beat.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.42,0:06:07.26,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wake you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end of the day of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.38,0:06:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of him. I'm afraid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the day to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can beat the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.80,0:06:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it's been started,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at the moment of being lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to continue to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.86,0:07:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop. Stop. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No last page.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.46,0:07:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah Yeah Yeah Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.97,0:07:38.77,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,477)\pos(151,871)}Episode 36: Hol Horse and Mondatta, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, we sincerely hope\Nyou've enjoyed today's flight from Aswan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be arriving on schedule at\NCairo International Airport shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoops, snooze you lose, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you, cowboy,\Nbut it looks like this is our cab now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No hard feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're going\Nto start crying like a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.87,0:08:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giza Pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Minoru House Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna open up this\Nsuitcase and let you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want some Card\Npain, I suggest you keep calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We clear? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.98,0:08:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you, uh, say something just now, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I did, it sure the hell wasn't to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now shut up and drive the cab!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:08:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, if you weren't\Nmaking such a damn racket,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have had to hogtie you and put\Nyou on the plane like a piece of luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.12,0:09:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a baby, Mondatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brother's got another month in\Nthe hospital thanks to that bomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you and I are partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now make sure those big ears are listening,\Nbecause here's what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to use your\Nbook of premonitions
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my assassin gun to stamp out Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph, and the rest of those SOBs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that, Boingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get that we haven't\Nknown each other long?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But from what I've gathered,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're afraid of just about anyone\Nthat's not your brother Oingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't you think this is the\Nperfect chance to avenge the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to be a\Nyellow-bellied coward forever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of options, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got no choice but to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for us to get our revenge, Boingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna let you loose now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you have to swear to me you won't\Ncarry on with all that infernal hollering,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.60,0:09:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now try and settle down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need you getting sick on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because believe it or not, I'm\Non your side in this whole mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.74,0:10:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, why do you have\Na puking kid? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got Moshe's sickness\Nfrom being on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mondatta, let's be pals from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Mondatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Whole Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's mean and I don't like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Mondatta was sleeping, Boingo\Ntied him up and stuffed him in a trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mondatta was taken from\Nhis brother Zenyatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even though Mondatta\Nwas scared out of his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he wanted to avenge his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he decided to work\Nup his co. Whole Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't even get near me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you're trying which\Nis all I can ask for at this point
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.16,0:11:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta know does your\Nstand really predict the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,future or is that just\Nsome cockamamie rumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that was all just a tall tale,\Nthen I brought you here for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean even with it your\Nbrother got blown to high heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is it kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a fraud?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd a new comic appear on a\Nblank page from out of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Boingo and Hol Horse were\Nwalking through the outskirts of Cairo,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they met a lady who was as\Npretty as the day was long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Whole Horse jump-kicked\Nthe lady in the neck! Hmm?
