Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this crap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must think I was born last night!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call this a prediction, Boingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This crap has to be made up or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stand, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just have to trust in its prophecies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:11:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're... they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.38,0:12:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're 100% right every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're right 100%?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You trying to pull a wool over my eyes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way some\Nlady's gonna give me her
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jewels after jump kicking her in the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd have to be off your rocker\Nto do something like that, hmm?
