Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Boingo, I'm proud\Nto say that I'm a gentleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a proper gentleman at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because at that, I got\Ngirls all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.46,0:12:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might tell a white lie now and again,\Nbut I'd never haul off and hit one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I respect all the ladies, the beauties,\Nthe plain ones, and even the ugly ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.56,0:12:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way your prediction\Nwill ever come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.44,0:12:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come hell or high water, I\Nswear I will never hit a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She could pay me every dime,\Nnickel, and quarter she had.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still wouldn't put my hands on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 100% true, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fancy prediction was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.82,0:13:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a scorpion in your shawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing's sting is a death sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You spotted that wretched creature before\Nit had a chance to crawl into my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't killed it, she\Nwould have been stung for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, let me repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would my necklace be a sufficient reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.68,0:13:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, this is my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountain and I are practically invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be the unstoppable duo.
