Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.56,0:14:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm going to\Nbe able to help you, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been my job to repair rooftops\Nin Cairo for around 40 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't say that I've\Never seen a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of the building's design,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the thing was built over\Na hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had to take a guess,\Nbased on the picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say you'd find it\Nsomewhere south of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The buildings in Cairo get older and\Nolder the farther south you travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I don't have\Nmore to go on, Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, understood.\NThanks for the update.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.30,0:14:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided to make a call to Japan, and\Nmy daughter's condition is much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's lost virtually all of her strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.60,0:15:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At best, she has three or four days left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can almost feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like Dio's right on top of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd bet anything that he's\Nhiding somewhere close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how do we find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll talk to everyone\Nhere until we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been a long time coming\Nbut it's time for our
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grand reunion I'm getting\Nsick of those faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought they'd get so close\Nto Master Dio's mansion but they're
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the collision course for his\Nbackyard and by the way listen Mondata.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to chat about your\Nlatest prediction you sure it's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100% foolproof. It's more than\Na little wacky. They're not
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dumb enough to fall for this\Nmy premonition my premonitions
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are always 100 percent accurate\Nis that what you're gonna say
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they are, yes. Come on,\Nyou really expect me to buy this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,load of baloney I think you've\Nlost your touch boy we found
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them shouted whole horse Joseph\NJotaro Polnareff and Avdol
