Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're out cold from\Nlosing all that blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.34,0:16:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky you, Ho! Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.98,0:17:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your chance to\Nfinish them off for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like hell I'm gonna buy that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your big premonition?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sticking my callous fingers at\NPolnareff's booger-infested nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, speak, Mondatta!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The part about killing him sounds\Ngood to me, but the rest of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not be planning\Nanything funny, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I was supposed to stick\Nmy fingers at Polnareff's nose,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd have to somehow get\Nclose enough to him to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of all that skullduggery?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should go\Nwith the direct approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and put a bullet in them with Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna be able\Nto fire a bullet, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.24,0:17:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you tried firing your\Nstand, fate wouldn't let you, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.84,0:17:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to trust me, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know from personal experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you try to go against a comic,\Nyou'll suffer the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fate, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 100% up to the whims\Nof fate, yes. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brother followed the\Ncomic and nearly died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:18:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother was trying\Nto save himself, but he
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,foolishly disguised himself\Nas Jotaro without thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.43,0:18:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he had trusted what he read\Nand not disguised himself,
