Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the real Jotaro would\Nhave been blown up, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The premonition itself was correct, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where did Polnareff go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey kid, Polnareff left the herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out where he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit! It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you'd like to be lanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.80,0:18:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.84,0:18:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ombecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly did you think you\Nwere trying to pull just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you know what's good for you,\Nkeep your hands where I can see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I noticed someone stalking\Nus like a desperate starving hyena and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.34,0:18:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't you know I was lucky enough to\Nstumble across our old friend whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're still
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.42,0:19:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to kill us which means you\Nhaven't learned your lesson yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say thanks for all the fun back in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very lucky Avdol survived our run-in\Nbecause if he hadn't you my friend would
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Already be dead, you here\Nalone, whole horse no
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way a coward like you\Nwouldn't come by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's hiding out nearby\Nright well where's your partner crap
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the upside, though he hasn't noticed\NBoingo yet, I still have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit he's gonna see the book in his fingers\Non your own you're not much of a threat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.48,0:19:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whole horse But I'm well aware that you\Nhave a special talent for picking allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.84,0:19:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've found someone\Nto work with like before,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.52,0:19:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that could make you a dangerous obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, where did your partner go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out with it, where's the other stand user?
