Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw a hand go into the box,\Nwhich means my hunt was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the word, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find the guy\Nthat was following us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's Avdol, and his\Nhead is straight for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your faith in the book and stick\Nyour fingers up Polnareff's nose, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.84,0:20:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, under the crate, show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, while he's looking the other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're hiding under there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone bled so much,\Nthey all passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky you, Ho Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance to finish them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what is this so-called\Nchance supposed to get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what do I do till then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Ho Horse, what\Nthe hell are you doing?
