Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't the foggiest\Nidea where to go from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.38,0:21:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not answering back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.44,0:21:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's off. Shit! What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You threw on me like\Nwhite on rice! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell do I make the rest of\Nthis stupid prediction come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.34,0:22:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell Horse! Bingo! Copy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm data
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me finders into improper
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.28,0:22:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think, microsite blowing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blowing you np I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words that you've written in the paper
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.10,0:22:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.52,0:22:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words that you've written on the paper
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do not believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all up to go! You can trust it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.00,0:23:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire Force! Boeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.06,0:23:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! Yes! Ok! I can't\Nbelieve it! Fire Force! Boeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.70,0:23:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've backed me into a corner.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.50,0:23:28.51,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.14,0:23:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to give you a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.58,0:23:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.94,0:23:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like there was a car\Naccident around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.96,0:23:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made you boy some\Ntea, so have some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fingers went up his nose,\Nand the prediction came true.
